  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>In the second part of the workshop we start enriching the data stream by
looking up some customer and product data. A  LEFT OUTER merge join resolves
all matching values of the sorted regional codes against the list of regions.  
If there's a regional code that doesnt match a region then a NULL value is displayed.
This ensures the data stream remains intact.</note>
      <xloc>48</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>503</width>
      <heigth>100</heigth>
